# GHSA-4w2j-m93h-cj5j: quinn-proto remote memory exhaustion (unbounded out-of-order
# stream reassembly) — compiled into the pinned uv/uvx binaries (0.11.21, ships
# quinn-proto 0.11.14; fix lands in 0.11.15, needs an uv release bump coordinated
# with the checksum-pinned Containerfile stage). uv/uvx are CI tooling only; the
# vulnerable path requires untrusted QUIC peer connections that CI never makes.
# Expires: 2026-10-14 | Reviewer: mvillmow | Category: ci-image-tooling (uv quinn-proto)
GHSA-4w2j-m93h-cj5j

